WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.625
Collected Intelligence Nodes.

00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:12.550
Each node represents a discrete piece of verified intelligence — a court ruling, a Hansard transcript, a lobbying registration, or a procurement anomaly.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:20.437
Nodes are cross-referenced against the TENET5 knowledge graph to identify connections that would be invisible to manual analysis.
